{"4640180": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Watermellionaire", "steam_appid": 4640180, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meet Your Quota. Or Else.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640180/extras/ce07620c461988d86d2d26a231d4a359.avif?t=1788318261\" width=600 height=336 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to your first day at the fruit packing facility. Combine the same fruits more quickly and efficiently than your opponents to earn points towards your daily quota.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you’re the worst-performing employee, or fail to fit all of the fruit in your box, be warned: there’s a guard with an itchy trigger finger who’s ready to fire you at a moment’s notice – literally.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose Your Way To Work</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640180/extras/db1ae4f3e0e1ee138aa6725ef854af40.poster.avif?t=1788318261\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640180/extras/db1ae4f3e0e1ee138aa6725ef854af40.webm?t=1788318261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640180/extras/db1ae4f3e0e1ee138aa6725ef854af40.mp4?t=1788318261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every second counts when all the employees are scrambling to avoid a performance review! That's why the totally safe fruit packing facility offers a variety of game modes.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo Sandbox - a slow-paced sandbox environment to rack up the highest score possible</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practice vs. CPU - perfect your strategy before you launch your full-time career</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle Royale - compete with up to 8 players with customizable match rules</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Boost Yourself. Sabotage Everyone Else.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640180/extras/4823cbdcc2e8029a1c082ac72fa05487.poster.avif?t=1788318261\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640180/extras/4823cbdcc2e8029a1c082ac72fa05487.webm?t=1788318261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640180/extras/4823cbdcc2e8029a1c082ac72fa05487.mp4?t=1788318261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With such high stakes on the line, it’s only natural some of the more…underhanded employees might try to disrupt your workflow!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Merge larger fruit to unlock powerful abilities that can turn the tide of any shift:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance your dropped fruit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throw vegetables in your co-workers' boxes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear sabotages from your own box</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Force unwanted fruit onto your opponents</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The company appreciates your continued productivity.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meet Your Quota. Or Else.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640180/extras/ce07620c461988d86d2d26a231d4a359.avif?t=1788318261\" width=600 height=336 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to your first day at the fruit packing facility. Combine the same fruits more quickly and efficiently than your opponents to earn points towards your daily quota.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you’re the worst-performing employee, or fail to fit all of the fruit in your box, be warned: there’s a guard with an itchy trigger finger who’s ready to fire you at a moment’s notice – literally.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose Your Way To Work</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640180/extras/db1ae4f3e0e1ee138aa6725ef854af40.poster.avif?t=1788318261\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640180/extras/db1ae4f3e0e1ee138aa6725ef854af40.webm?t=1788318261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640180/extras/db1ae4f3e0e1ee138aa6725ef854af40.mp4?t=1788318261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every second counts when all the employees are scrambling to avoid a performance review! That's why the totally safe fruit packing facility offers a variety of game modes.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo Sandbox - a slow-paced sandbox environment to rack up the highest score possible</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practice vs. CPU - perfect your strategy before you launch your full-time career</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle Royale - compete with up to 8 players with customizable match rules</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Boost Yourself. Sabotage Everyone Else.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640180/extras/4823cbdcc2e8029a1c082ac72fa05487.poster.avif?t=1788318261\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640180/extras/4823cbdcc2e8029a1c082ac72fa05487.webm?t=1788318261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640180/extras/4823cbdcc2e8029a1c082ac72fa05487.mp4?t=1788318261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With such high stakes on the line, it’s only natural some of the more…underhanded employees might try to disrupt your workflow!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Merge larger fruit to unlock powerful abilities that can turn the tide of any shift:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance your dropped fruit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throw vegetables in your co-workers' boxes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear sabotages from your own box</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Force unwanted fruit onto your opponents</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The company appreciates your continued productivity.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Watermellionaire is a dark battle royale fruit-matching game. Pitted against other employees, you compete to become the Most Valuable Packer (MVP) - those who fail are fired. Faced with nothing but a box, some fruit and a guard watching your every move, only one person can come out on top.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640180/519f7cdd45bbf977da7310c58bd3bb8dd8a97a7a/header.jpg?t=1788318261", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640180/ba36903acad1ede5e4eff8b58e7d982382e23387/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788318261", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640180/ba36903acad1ede5e4eff8b58e7d982382e23387/